item 4 (Security)\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-6\", \"description\": \"Test harness uses Vitest + Testing Library for unit/component tests and Playwright for e2e (tests/e2e), covering withHandler branches, parsePagination, formatInSchoolTz, env.ts validation, DataTable/ConfirmDialog/useToast component behaviour, the no-restricted-imports lint rule, and the Playwright/axe scenarios listed in Test Requirements.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Test Requirements section\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-7\", \"description\": \"A fresh clone must be runnable end-to-end (docker compose up -d && npm install && npm run db:migrate && npm run db:seed && npm run dev) and viewable at localhost:3000 in under 5 minutes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Goals, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-8\", \"description\": \"npm run lint, npm run typecheck, npm run test and npm run test:e2e must all pass on a fresh clone.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Goals, item 3\" }\n  ],\n\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 100,\n  \"clarificationLog\": [],\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-16T15:09:02Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 48,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 100,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-16T15:09:02Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"techStack\": \"react\",\n  \"confidencePct\": 100,\n  \"detectionNotes\": \"PRD run mode explicitly states '--greenfield --tech-stack react' and the Platform Context fixes Next.js 14 (App Router), React 18, TypeScript strict. No enum value exists for 'nextjs' specifically, so 'react' is used as the closest match. Full stack detected: Next.js 14 App Router / React 18 / TypeScript strict; Material UI v9 (@mui/material, @mui/x-data-grid, @mui/x-date-pickers, @mui/x-charts, @mui/x-scheduler) via @emotion styling; PostgreSQL 16 via Prisma ORM; Auth.js (NextAuth v5) Credentials provider planned for PRD-01 (not built here); Zod validation; React Hook Form; Vitest + Testing Library + Playwright for tests; Docker Compose for local Postgres. Styling is CSS-in-JS via MUI's theme/sx/styled() (emotion) with no Tailwind/CSS Modules; 'css' is recorded as the closest schema fit since no CSS-in-JS option exists.\",\n  \"cssPreprocessor\": \"css\"\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
