 Keep `AuditLog.ip`, keep `UserStatus.ARCHIVED` and keep the\nexisting extra indexes. Add only\n`@@index([entityType, entityId])` and `@@index([actorId, createdAt])` to\nAuditLog, plus any User auth fields the diff finds missing\n(failedLoginCount, lockedUntil, lastLoginAt, passwordChangedAt). Apply them\nin one `prisma migrate dev --name auth_reconcile` migration. FR-4's \"status\n!= ACTIVE\" check already rejects ARCHIVED.\n\n**Consequences.** The migration has no destructive steps. It adds indexes and\nnullable or defaulted columns only.\n\n_Cites: FR-1, FR-2, FR-4, FR-6, NFR-9_\n\n## ADR-10: Tests with the existing Vitest + Playwright; no new test tooling\n\n**Decision.** Run unit and integration tests (FR-36) in `vitest`, calling the\nlimiter, tokens, policy and callbackUrl modules as pure functions. Test the\nauthorize function and the service functions against the test DB. Use\n`@playwright/test` (with the installed `@axe-core/playwright` for NFR-5) for\nsign-in/out, the failure message and forgot→reset. The reset link comes from\nthe logged `sendAuthEmail` output (FR-22).\n\n_Cites: FR-22, FR-36, NFR-5, NFR-10_\ntotal 176\ndrwxr-xr-x  8 ikramaansari  staff    256 Nov  4 11:40 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  7 ikramaansari  staff    224 Oct 16 20:20 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  13580 Nov  4 11:40 api-contracts.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff   1152 Nov  4 11:40 handoff-to-dev-planning.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  17106 Nov  4 11:35 requirements-analysis-notes.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  30533 Nov  4 11:39 system-design.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  11861 Nov  4 11:35 tech-stack-decisions.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff    340 Nov  4 11:40 threat-model-notes.json\n?? artifacts/","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XAP84zWknDnX79Fp6RAwJW","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
