{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk6Xwd426Vcv53SxN1ws","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I rewrote `artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md` for SH-1. It replaces the earlier version, which still listed /login, the seed users and the role/status index as work to do, though all three now exist.\n\nThe stack stays exactly as declared, and this ticket adds no new packages. It has 5 decisions, each tied to its requirement ids:\n\n1. **No changes to the stack.** No new dependencies.\n2. **Shell wiring.** The app layout looks up the signed-in user on the server and passes it to `AppShell`. That replaces `PLACEHOLDER_USER` and drives the name, role badge, initials, the \"Account security\" item and `signOut()`. There is no `SessionProvider`, so there is still only one source of \"current user\".\n3. **The four missing pages.**\n   - **Invite and reset links:** these pages check the link on the server before showing anything, then reuse the existing `SetPasswordForm`, `postJson` and `applyFieldErrors` against the auth APIs that already exist.\n   - **`/forgot-password`:** shows the same message whatever the response, so it doesn't reveal which emails have accounts.\n   - **`/account/security`:** uses the existing change-password API.\n4. **Tests.**\n   - **Integration:** a new `tests/integration/auth.test.ts`. It runs only when `TEST_DATABASE_URL` is set, like the existing `email-dispatch` test.\n   - **End-to-end:** a new `tests/e2e/auth.spec.ts` that runs its tests one at a time and reads the reset link from the `EmailOutbox` table.\n5. **No database change.** `AuditLog.ip` keeps its name. FR-32 is still flagged for your sign-off.\n\nThe main finding from re-checking the code is that `SetPasswordForm` and its helpers already exist but no page uses them yet. The new pages are told to build on them rather than duplicate them.\n\nI didn't write any other sub-task's files. The notes at the end of the file list the intake blockers that `arch-design-system` must surface."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4520,"cache_read_input_tokens":48574,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4520},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1bd6c0dc-83dd-43e6-ae41-e48cadc78ecd","uuid":"6a8717d6-c705-4f9c-aba8-cd9ae31b6aa0","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:28:06.431Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk6XwMS7eyoiF2D4ZcvP"}
