{"duration_api_ms":108886,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6161ef1e-09c5-429b-90ef-ea4fc0ebef55","total_cost_usd":0.6273029999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":18,"cache_creation_input_tokens":43657,"cache_read_input_tokens":343575,"output_tokens":10463,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2104},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":43657,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":839,"cache_read_input_tokens":47424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6188,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6188},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":18,"outputTokens":10463,"cacheReadInputTokens":343575,"cacheCreationInputTokens":43657,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6273029999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":2104,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":43657,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":9,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I wrote the SH-8 stack decisions to `artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md`, replacing the old SH-7 file. It has nine decision records, each citing the FR/NFR ids that drove it, and every id cited exists in `requirements.json`. The current stack (Next 14, Prisma, Auth.js, MUI 9.5.0) covers everything the requirements need. These six decisions affect what dev builds:\n\n- **New libraries are pinned.** The latest `file-type` needs Node 22, but the project supports Node 18.18 and up, so it's pinned to 20.5.0. The other four are `react-markdown` 10.1.0, `remark-gfm` 4.0.1, `rehype-sanitize` 6.0.0 and `@dnd-kit/sortable` 10.0.0.\n- **Uploads use `busboy`, not `request.formData()`.** `formData()` loads the whole file into memory, which breaks NFR-5 for 25 MB files. `busboy` 1.6.0 is already installed because Next.js depends on it, so nothing new gets added. The catch: if a future Next.js upgrade drops it, we'll need to add it ourselves. This is the one place the design leans on a library outside the approved list.\n- **Video embeds need a config change.** The site's security policy in `next.config.js` currently blocks all iframes, so YouTube and Vimeo videos (FR-30) wouldn't load. One line adding those two sites fixes it.\n- **Logo files need a public path.** `src/middleware.ts` returns 401 to signed-out users on any `/api/` path not on the public list. `/api/files/` has to go on that list so logos load without signing in. Each file request then goes through the access check, which refuses signed-out users for anything that isn't a logo.\n- **File-type checks use one table.** It covers every allowed extension. txt, csv and SVG must have no detectable signature. docx, xlsx and pptx may look like zip files. SVG is accepted only as a logo.\n- **The repo has no root `.gitignore`.** One needs creating with `uploads/` in it.\n\nThe file ends with three open risks: dev must check every MUI component against the docs server, the `busboy` dependency above, and the low-confidence logo and settings-page defaults.\n\nI didn't write any other sub-task's files. The other architect files still hold SH-7 content and will be overwritten by their own sub-tasks.","ttft_ms":4200,"type":"result","duration_ms":117921,"uuid":"b7eb58b9-0dae-4abf-b0eb-35b8abed7e1b","ttft_stream_ms":2267,"time_to_request_ms":356,"first_content_frame_ms":2268,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":18,"outputTokens":10463,"cacheReadInputTokens":343575,"cacheCreationInputTokens":43657,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6273029999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":2104,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":43657,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
