stack (confirmed against the workspace).** `artifacts/intake/tech-stack.json` reports `react` at 100% confidence, and `package.json` matches: Next.js 14.2.18 App Router, React 18.3.1, TypeScript 5.5.4 strict, Prisma 5.20.0 on PostgreSQL 16, Auth.js 5.0.0-beta.25, Zod 3.23.8, react-hook-form 7.53.0, and MUI 9.5.0 (material, icons-material, material-nextjs, x-data-grid, x-date-pickers, x-charts). Also installed: @dnd-kit/core 6.3.1 + @dnd-kit/sortable 10.0.0, date-fns 3.6.0 / date-fns-tz 3.2.0, react-markdown 10.1.0, remark-gfm 4.0.1, rehype-sanitize 6.0.0, file-type 20.5.0, decimal.js 10.6.0 (via Prisma), Vitest 2.1.1 (jsdom) and Playwright 1.47.2. `engines.node >=18.18.0`.\n\nNone of the FR/NFRs needs a different stack. There is no latency target beyond NFR-3, no offline requirement and no realtime requirement. **Overall decision: add no new dependencies.** The ADRs below record how PRD-09 fits into this stack and how to resolve the environment blockers that intake reported.\n\n---\n\n## ADR-1: Keep the existing stack and add zero dependencies\n\n**Context.** NFR-11 forbids re-scaffolding or duplicating helpers. NFR-6 allows UI only from MUI v9.5.0 and MUI X. Every library that PRD-09 needs is already a direct dependency: Markdown (NFR-10), drag-to-reorder for rubric criteria (FR-11, @dnd-kit/sortable), date/timezone maths (FR-10, FR-23, NFR-9, date-fns-tz), Decimal maths (NFR-1, decimal.js via Prisma), forms and validation (FR-7, react-hook-form + Zod), and the date-time picker (FR-9, @mui/x-date-pickers, with the `AdapterDateFns` provider already in `src/app/providers.tsx`).\n\n**Decision.** Add nothing to `dependencies` or `devDependencies`. Use the following:\n| Need | Use | Req |\n|---|---|---|\n| Score maths | `Prisma.Decimal` (from `@prisma/client`). Never import `decimal.js` directly, so the version cannot drift from Prisma's. | FR-31, FR-36, NFR-1 |\n| Markdown render | react-markdown + remark-gfm + rehype-sanitize, with components mapped to MUI | FR-19, FR-29, NFR-10 |\n| Rubric criterion reorder | @dnd-kit/sortable (Up/Down buttons as the keyboard fallback, NFR-17) | FR-11 |\n| Forms | react-hook-form + `@hookform/resolvers/zod` with the shared schemas in `src/lib/validators/assignments.ts` | FR-7, FR-9 |\n| Due date-time input | `@mui/x-date-pickers` `DateTimePicker` | FR-9, FR-12 |\n| File sniffing | Already done server-side by the existing files service (file-type 20.5.0). Nothing new in PRD-09. | FR-47, FR-53 |\n\n**Consequences.** No lockfile churn from new packages. Anything outside this list that dev reaches for is a scope smell. ESLint `no-restricted-imports` (NFR-6) still guards the UI side.\n\n---\n\n## ADR-2: Fix the MUI X break by pinning `@mui/x-internals` to 9.1.0 through `overrides`\n\ntotal 240\ndrwxr-xr-x   8 ikramaansari  staff    256 Nov  9 10:32 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  11 ikramaansari  staff    352 Nov  5 11:37 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  32072 Nov  9 10:31 api-contracts.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   2339 Nov  9 10:32 handoff-to-dev-planning.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  28433 Nov  9 10:26 requirements-analysis-notes.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  34575 Nov  9 10:29 system-design.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  12704 Nov  9 10:25 tech-stack-decisions.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff    396 Nov  9 10:32 threat-model-notes.json\ndd8bf49 cursor: empty commit to allow worktree creation\n    \"@dnd-kit/core\": \"6.3.1\",\n    \"@dnd-kit/sortable\": \"10.0.0\",\n    \"@mui/icons-material\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/material\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/material-nextjs\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/x-charts\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/x-data-grid\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/x-date-pickers\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@prisma/client\": \"5.20.0\",\n    \"next\": \"14.2.18\",\n    \"next-auth\": \"5.0.0-beta.25\",\n    \"react\": \"18.3.1\",\n    \"zod\": \"3.23.8\"\n    \"@playwright/test\": \"1.47.2\",\n    \"prisma\": \"5.20.0\",\n    \"vitest\": \"2.1.1\"\n    \"@mui/x-in